cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AstraCell in research or engineering work, please cite this software."
title: "AstraCell: observability-aware battery fault identifiability"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Malka
    given-names: Shiloh
    alias: shilohhm
repository-code: "https://github.com/shilohhm/AstraCell"
url: "https://github.com/shilohhm/AstraCell"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.9.0
abstract: >-
  AstraCell determines which lithium-ion battery-pack faults are identifiable under a
  specified model, sensor topology, noise process, and excitation. It combines Fisher
  information, Cramér-Rao bounds, model-bias gating, calibrated abstention, and
  counterfactual experiment design.
keywords:
  - battery diagnostics
  - fault identifiability
  - observability
  - Fisher information
  - Cramér-Rao bound
